<title>USA: Numerex extends stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>Numerex extends stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>MEDIA, Pa. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Numerex Corp said its board has authorized the purchase of up to 1,000,000 shares of its common stock in open market purchases to be made from time-to-time during the next 12 months.</p>
<p>Company president Jack Reis said, &quot;During the past twelve months, the company has purchased about 470,000 shares in conjunction with our buyback program. We continue to view our current stock price as undervalued and believe that an extension of the stock buyback is a worthwhile use of cash at this time.&quot;</p>
</text>
